  <figcaption>搜尋「面試簡報」在 TOP 2</figcaption>
</figure>

<h3 id="-書籍銷售成績">書籍銷售成績<a class="h-anchor" href="#-%e6%9b%b8%e7%b1%8d%e9%8a%b7%e5%94%ae%e6%88%90%e7%b8%be" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h3>
<p><a href="https://www.tenlong.com.tw/products/9789864348008">JavaScript 爬蟲新思路</a>在預購時獲得週排行榜 TOP 2</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202206/benefits-of-self-media-for-engineers/images/benefits-of-self-media-for-engineers-06.webp" width="1400" height="859" alt="書籍銷售成績（圖 6）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p><a href="https://www.tenlong.com.tw/products/9786263331525">給全端工程師的職涯生存筆記</a>在預購時獲得週行榜 TOP 1</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202206/benefits-of-self-media-for-engineers/images/benefits-of-self-media-for-engineers-07.webp" width="1400" height="935" alt="書籍銷售成績（圖 7）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<h3 id="-fb-廣告">FB 廣告<a class="h-anchor" href="#-fb-%e5%bb%a3%e5%91%8a" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h3>
<p>我從來沒想過自己的書籍會出現 FB 的廣告當中，儘管我是精準 TA，但看到的時候還是非常感動</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202206/benefits-of-self-media-for-engineers/images/benefits-of-self-media-for-engineers-08.webp" width="996" height="759" alt="FB 廣告（圖 8）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<h3 id="-比賽得獎">比賽得獎<a class="h-anchor" href="#-%e6%af%94%e8%b3%bd%e5%be%97%e7%8d%8e" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h3>
<div class="gallery-row cols-2">

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202206/benefits-of-self-media-for-engineers/images/benefits-of-self-media-for-engineers-09.webp" width="1108" height="1477" alt="比賽得獎（圖 9）" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
</figure>

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202206/benefits-of-self-media-for-engineers/images/benefits-of-self-media-for-engineers-10.webp" width="1108" height="1477" alt="第 12 屆 iT 邦幫忙鐵人賽 AI＆Data 組佳作：「行銷廣告、電商小編的武器，FB &amp; IG 爬蟲專案從零開始」" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
